# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# THE MANIFEST RULE: every variable the app reads is listed here, set or not.
# A var missing from this file is one a fresh checkout cannot discover it
# needs. For each var, document what it is FOR and what happens when it is
# unset — an explicit failure mode ("503s", "feature declines"), never a
# silent fallback.
#
# cp .dev.vars.example .dev.vars   ← .dev.vars is gitignored and NEVER deploys.
# Secrets deploy via `wrangler secret put <NAME> [--env <env>]`.
# Non-secret deployables live in wrangler.jsonc `vars` — and note `vars` does
# NOT inherit into environments: every var must be repeated per env block or
# it silently vanishes there.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Postgres connection. Unset: server 500s at first query.
DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:local@127.0.0.1:55432/app

# Session cookie signing. Unset: auth refuses to start.
SESSION_SECRET=dev-only-not-a-secret

# 'development' | 'demo' | 'production'. Gates test-only escape hatches closed
# in production. Unset: treated as production (fail closed).
ENVIRONMENT=development
